portunity to  get a good job get a better job to get  more money  if you're out of work as i say getting a  job is is one of the best ways that you  can alleviate poverty and if you're in  work but on low pay  having things like the universal credit  taper rate having the uh the living wage  uh increase these things will help and  where they aren't quite getting there  that's where the targeted support comes  in okay oh well as i said i've just  underlined again one in four families  fuel poverty um what are the russians up  to buzzing our airspace  i i i can't i can't work out what russia  hopes to achieve  by this series of quite provocative or  indeed very provocative actions we  we we need them to understand that they  can be  an important significant player on the  world stage without this  the kind of military  aggression that we're seeing or this  military posturing that we're seeing  what happened can you underline that uh  so i don't i i don't have all the  details at the moment i don't want to  as you can imagine with something as  sensitive as this i don't want to  speculate or make it basically those  pictures are not relating to what we're  talking about just at the moment because  it was four aircraft russian aircraft  that was buzzing our airspace and the  raf had to go up and see them off  yeah and look this is not the first time  something like this has happened  and we have made it absolutely clear  that whether it is our own airspace  whether it is the territorial integrity  of our nato allies we stand shouldered  shoulder and indeed with the aggressive  posture that nato are putting towards  ukraine we have also said that we  absolutely support ukraine's right to be  a sovereign independent nation  we have provided  support over a number of years through  operation orbital which is training of  the ukrainian military and more recently  we've supported them with defensive  military equipment and we're making it  very clear foreign secretary uh did